+#
+# Topology:
+#    +---------+
+#    | public  |
+#    +----+----+
+#         |
+#    +----+---+
+#    | lr-frr | (in VRF 10)
+#    +----+---+
+#         |
+#  +------+-------+
+#  |local-bgp-port| (in VRF 10)
+#  +--------------+
